sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Build job
  participant P as pgoctl
  participant G as GitHub Releases
  B->>P: pgoctl store restore --out default.pgo
  P->>G: list the releases of the key (with pagination)
  G-->>P: releases
  Note over P: drop drafts, days without default.pgo,<br/>and unknown schema_version
  loop newest day first
    P->>G: download manifest.json and default.pgo
    alt sha256 matches the manifest
      P-->>B: default.pgo, exit 0
    else asset missing or sha256 wrong
      Note over P: try the next newest day
    end
  end
  opt no usable day
    P-->>B: exit 3, build without PGO, note in the job summary
  end
